@startuml
class SeatCategory {
  - String name
  - double price
}
class Seat {
  - int row
  - int number
  - boolean isSold
  - SeatCategory category
}
class SeatCategoryFactory {
  - Map<String, SeatCategory> cache
  + SeatCategory getCategory(String name)
}
Seat --> SeatCategory : refers to
SeatCategoryFactory ..> SeatCategory : creates & caches
note right of SeatCategoryFactory : Flyweight Factory
note right of SeatCategory : Flyweight
@enduml
